<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cbalance</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cbalance
</pre>
<p>Shows how much money is in your clan's treasury. Any member of the clan 
can look, but only at the clan chest in the clan house.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
